flowchart TD
    Pick["Choose one real packet<br/><b>does:</b> fixes a concrete 5-tuple and direction<br/><b>why next:</b> every later observation needs the same packet identity<br/><b>state:</b> expected src/dst/proto/ports"]
    Driver["driver RX / XDP<br/><b>does:</b> receives DMA buffer and may run XDP before skb allocation<br/><b>why next:</b> XDP_PASS is the handoff into the skb stack<br/><b>state:</b> packet consumed by XDP or wrapped as skb"]
    GRO["skb + GRO<br/><b>does:</b> creates skb metadata and may coalesce segments<br/><b>why next:</b> protocol dispatch needs skb protocol and headers<br/><b>state:</b> skb has L2/L3 offsets and possible GRO aggregate"]
    Core["__netif_receive_skb_core<br/><b>does:</b> runs ingress taps, tc, and packet_type dispatch<br/><b>why next:</b> IPv4 handler owns ETH_P_IP packets<br/><b>state:</b> skb delivered to ip_rcv or diverted/dropped"]
    Pre["PREROUTING<br/><b>does:</b> defrag/conntrack/DNAT/filter before route lookup<br/><b>why next:</b> route must see any destination rewrite<br/><b>state:</b> nfct attached, dst may be changed"]
    Route["route lookup<br/><b>does:</b> maps flow to local delivery or forwarding<br/><b>why next:</b> dst->input selects the next stack function<br/><b>state:</b> skb_dst points at rtable"]
    Decision{"destination?"}
    Local["LOCAL_IN + transport<br/><b>does:</b> applies host policy then looks up TCP/UDP socket<br/><b>why next:</b> accepted data wakes application receive path<br/><b>state:</b> skb queued or consumed by protocol"]
    Forward["FORWARD + POST_ROUTING<br/><b>does:</b> applies transit policy and final SNAT/output checks<br/><b>why next:</b> accepted skb can enter device output path<br/><b>state:</b> skb has egress route/device"]
    App["application read<br/><b>does:</b> copies socket receive data to user buffer<br/><b>state:</b> packet's payload is now app-visible"]
    Tx["qdisc + driver TX<br/><b>does:</b> schedules frame and gives descriptors to NIC<br/><b>state:</b> forwarded packet leaves the host"]

    Pick --> Driver --> GRO --> Core --> Pre --> Route --> Decision
    Decision -->|local| Local --> App
    Decision -->|forwarded| Forward --> Tx

    classDef observe fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb
    classDef hook fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#d97706
    classDef state fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a
    class Pick,App,Tx observe
    class Driver,Core,Pre,Forward hook
    class GRO,Route,Decision,Local state
